of the mind. It has been argued that L. Ron Hubbard deliberately created the
`religion' Scientology to function as a bundle of memes which would cause his
enrichment.  The memes function on multiple levels, for example:

1) they appear to provide a method to improve ones mental health
2) they cause many members to actively recruit new members
3) they predispose one to give money and power to L. Ron Hubbard (when he
       was alive)

Hubbard crafted his memes so that points one and two were overt but the true
goal or `secret meaning' was point three. Within the group there are other
examples.

To move up in the Scientology organization apparently one must take a test
similar to a lie detector test. One is hooked up to an `E-meter' which
functions as a crude lie detector and one is then supposed to tell all of
ones deepest most comprimising secrets to a superior member of the group.

This process has two meanings: an overt one and a secret one.
The overt meaning is that this process will help you achieve better
mental health. The covert meaning is that the information you give 
can be used to blackmail you in the future if you choose to act against
the organization.

This information comes from the issue of Time magazine which did a cover
story on Scientology. I do not know how accurate it is. I am sure that
Scientologists would completely disagree with this post.

